A client, data and server patch and a restart of the game server are planned on March 19th, 2020 in order to implement the following changes, additions and fixes:

[h2]Changes:[/h2]
– Icons on the right of the Ranger NPCs' name scaled to 24x24;
– Mission Booklet now accessible by shift+E and with a link to the Encyclopedia.

[h2]Improvements & bug fixes:[/h2]
–  A bug blocking a mission if an NPC is politely asked a question about rumors during the dialogue about it;
–  Some NPCs responding "You are too far away" when asked;
–  Scroll bar losing position when group window is minimized;
–  Issues resulting from the addition of icons in the drop-down menus.

[h2]Additions:[/h2]
–  The nation merchants that accept Elyps now offer coloured generic raw materials (purple, green, turquoise, red, blue);
–  Added confirmation request for the removing of landmarks.

The Ryzom Team remains at your disposal for any additional information, and wishes you all the best!

